# The release channels of the Nyx toolchain.
#
# Written by tools/publish_channels.ps1, which verifies every archive by extracting and running it
# before this file names it. A URL here is a URL that answered.
#
#     channel <name> <version> ["<archive URL>"] [notes]
#
# A channel with no URL is published *by announcement only*: clients report that a release exists and
# fetch nothing, which is the honest state of a channel whose build is not ready.
#
# Versions compare as dotted numbers, and a `-suffix` sorts before its release, so 3.15.0-beta.1 is
# older than 3.15.0. That is what makes Beta usable: a beta never replaces the release it precedes.

channel Stable       3.14.0             "https://github.com/jiayin0113-afk/nyx-dist/releases/download/v3.14.0/nyx-3.14.0-windows-x86_64.tar.gz"  current release
channel Beta         3.15.0-beta.1      "https://github.com/jiayin0113-afk/nyx-dist/releases/download/v3.15.0-beta.1/nyx-3.15.0-beta.1-windows-x86_64.tar.gz"  features still moving; behaviour can change between builds
channel TestEdition  3.16.0-test.1      "https://github.com/jiayin0113-afk/nyx-dist/releases/download/v3.16.0-test.1/nyx-3.16.0-test.1-windows-x86_64.tar.gz"  the bleeding edge; published from a work-in-progress branch
channel Preview      3.14.0             "https://github.com/jiayin0113-afk/nyx-dist/releases/download/v3.14.0/nyx-3.14.0-windows-x86_64.tar.gz"  published more often than Stable
